      oddCompactRemainderPart23Grade6 u t w := by
  unfold oddCompactRemainderPart23 oddCompactRemainderPart23Grade3 oddCompactRemainderPart23Grade6
  simp only [oddCompactUnitSlack_eq hu0 hu1 ht0 ht1 hw0 hw1]
